Package: repair
Title: Measurement-Error-Corrected Regression of Random Coefficients
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Zach", "Vig", , "zachvig@rocketmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the REPAIR modified method-of-moments estimator for
    structural regressions involving random coefficients from Gaussian mixed
    models. Extracts likelihood-only scores and sampling-error covariances,
    aligns them with person-level data by identifier, and reports conditional
    model-based inference and analysis diagnostics.
URL: https://zacharyvig.github.io/repair/, https://github.com/zacharyvig/repair
BugReports: https://github.com/zacharyvig/repair/issues
